   "type": "text",
   "text": "\"Nothing leaks downward by proximity.\"\n\nA dimension the owner's seat holds and does not WRITE AND ROUTE is\ndeleted from the product \u2014 and the deletion is SILENT: the\ndownstream agent invents a plausible replacement rather than raising\na hand.",
