   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "text": "THE MEASURING STICK\n\nSPEC.md alone, plus only what SPEC.md explicitly routes to,\nreproduces the design intent in a reader who has NONE of your\ncontext.",
   "originalText": "THE MEASURING STICK\n\nSPEC.md alone, plus only what SPEC.md explicitly routes to,\nreproduces the design intent in a reader who has NONE of your\ncontext.",
