   "type": "text",
   "text": "THE SPEC IS THE ROUTER\n\nThe downstream reader's world is SPEC.md; their\ncuriosity does not extend past it.\n\n\"A file's existence is not a route.\"\n\nNothing load-bearing may depend on a reader's\ninitiative.",
   "originalText": "THE SPEC IS THE ROUTER\n\nThe downstream reader's world is SPEC.md; their\ncuriosity does not extend past it.\n\n\"A file's existence is not a route.\"\n\nNothing load-bearing may depend on a reader's\ninitiative.",
